{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 147,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise the LORD, for it is good to sing praises to our God; for it is pleasant and fitting to praise him.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "147:1 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要赞美耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要讚美耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD builds up Jerusalem. He gathers together the outcasts of Israel.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "147:2 LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华建造， 中被赶散的人。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華建造， 中被趕散的人。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "He heals the broken in heart, and binds up their wounds.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他医好伤心的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他醫好傷心的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "He counts the number of the stars. He calls them all by their names.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他数点星宿的数目，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他數點星宿的數目，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Great is our Lord, and mighty in power. understanding is infinite.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们的主为大，最有能力；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們的主為大，最有能力；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD upholds the humble. He brings the wicked down to the ground.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华扶持谦卑人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華扶持謙卑人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Sing to the LORD with thanksgiving. Sing praises on the harp to our God,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要以感谢向耶和华歌唱，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要以感謝向耶和華歌唱，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "who covers the sky with clouds, prepares rain for the earth, makes grass grow on the mountains.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他用云遮天，为地降雨，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他用雲遮天，為地降雨，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "He provides food for the livestock, and for the young ravens when they call.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他赐食给走兽",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他賜食給走獸",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "He doesn’t delight in the strength of the horse. He takes no pleasure in the legs of a man.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他不喜悦马的力， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他不喜悅馬的力， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD takes pleasure in those who fear him, in those who hope in his loving kindness.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华喜爱敬畏他",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華喜愛敬畏他",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise the LORD, Jerusalem! Praise your God, Zion!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "啊，你要颂赞耶和华！ 哪，你要赞美你的 神！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "啊，你要頌讚耶和華！ 哪，你要讚美你的上帝！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "For he has strengthened the bars of your gates. He has blessed your children within you.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为他坚固了你的门闩，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為他堅固了你的門閂，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "He makes peace in your borders. He fills you with the finest of the wheat.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他使你境内平安，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他使你境內平安，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "He sends out his commandment to the earth. His word runs very swiftly.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他发命在地；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他發命在地；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "He gives snow like wool, and scatters frost like ashes.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他降雪如羊毛，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他降雪如羊毛，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "He hurls down his hail like pebbles. Who can stand before his cold?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他掷下冰雹如碎渣；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他擲下冰雹如碎渣；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "He sends out his word, and melts them. He causes his wind to blow, and the waters flow.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他一出令，这些就都消化；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他一出令，這些就都消化；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "19",
      "en": {
        "text": "He shows his word to Jacob, his statutes and his ordinances to Israel.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他将他的道指示， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他將他的道指示， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "20",
      "en": {
        "text": "He has not done this for just any nation. They don’t know his ordinances. Praise the LORD!",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "147:20 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "别国他都没有这样待过；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "別國他都沒有這樣待過；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}